{
  "reason": "Modify only model_design because the experiment changes loss reduction inside train_category. Current macro validation HR@10 is 0.52 versus the baseline’s 0.505, while Electronics declines from 0.42 to 0.40; uniform transition weighting may underemphasize recent intent, but these results do not establish causality. Historical sampled-softmax successes support retaining that objective, and the unsuccessful attention modification motivates holding the current architecture fixed.",
  "module": [
    "model_design"
  ],
  "plan": {
    "data_processing_and_feature_engineering": null,
    "model_design": "Replace uniform temporal averaging of the existing sampled-softmax ranking and auxiliary BCE losses with exponential recency weighting, leaving the current RecurrentMemory architecture, jointly trained attention, and item bias unchanged. In train_category, preserve seq, pos, neg, pos_scores, neg_scores, valid_positions, allowed, candidate_logits, and per_position; construct position indices on pos.device, find each row’s last valid supervised index, and assign valid positions weights = 0.9 ** d where d is their distance before that index, with padding assigned zero weight. Compute ranking_loss and positive_loss as weighted sums of their unreduced per-position losses divided by weights.sum().clamp_min(1e-8), and compute negative_loss by first averaging F.softplus(neg_scores) over allowed negatives at each position using allowed.sum(-1).clamp_min(1), then applying the same weighted reduction; positions without allowed negatives contribute zero negative loss, and loss remains ranking_loss + 0.2 * (positive_loss + negative_loss). Explicitly keep unchanged preprocessing seed 0, training seed 42, supplied splits, random-prefix sampling, 32 negatives and their masks, all architecture and training hyperparameters, AdamW, learning-rate schedule, clipping, environment-controlled SASREC_EPOCHS default 200, deadlines, early stopping, and HR@10 checkpoint selection with NDCG tie-breaking; preserve all existing function signatures and variable names, DATA_DIR=os.environ['GAGC_DATA_DIR'], trial-local artifacts, write_predictor, inference preprocessing, and all four dataset routes loading exactly one newly trained selected checkpoint per category, without ensembles, averaging, external scoring components, additional data, hidden-test access, or other-trial checkpoint reuse. Evaluate the temporal-weighting hypothesis through the unchanged pinned host macro validation HR@10 with 200 users per category, 99 unique negatives, and evaluation seed 42 under single-GPU execution and the shared search budget; treat 0.53–0.54 as a hypothesis rather than an observed improvement.",
    "training_evaluation": null
  }
}
